d":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"49 min"},{"id":"tt38336631:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"As Emi continues to outsmart the detectives, a disturbing note found in his house rattles Kim Seok and drives the pair to Emi's performance venue.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQ93tOn0izBk2PUNaG4Li3ADBpv.jpg","released":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"tt38336631:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Despite official police intervention, Kim Seok and Inose investigate from their home countries. Later, Kim Seok confronts pachinko kingpin Seo Hyun-tae.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qvBfxnqh1saHxuY5jr94xuu4Ts0.jpg","released":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt38336631:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"Framed and on the run, Kim Seok reaches Hong Kong. Inose meets agent Yoon Soo-kyung and learns Hyun-tae's dark scheme is already in motion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4n6Bcw91JG5sS44sNopaKHJ4Qz3.jpg","released":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"39 min"},{"id":"tt38336631:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Episodio 7","overview":"Kim Seok captures and tortures Hyun-tae to unearth buried memories, only to be left spiraling until unexpected help arrives.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tOB2WMb0Yj4InDL5CNdxkZHiB3A.jpg","released":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"35 min"},{"id":"tt38336631:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Episodio 8","overview":"Kim Seok reaches Central Asia's Blue Road in pursuit of Hyun-tae, but a calm confession reveals the brutal truth may be closer than he thinks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cUVIEX6cD0wyobT9L4cFuMs7z5u.jpg","released":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"}]}}